WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
If you are self-employed, for example in cleaning, delivery or construction, you declare your own income through Self Assessment. Dates for the 2025-2026 tax year: – Register: before 5 October 2026, if it is your first return.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
– Paper return: by 31 October 2026. – Online return: by 31 January 2027. – Pay: by 31 January 2027. Keep your invoices and work expenses all year. If you are late, there are penalties.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.600
HMRC will never ask for your bank details by text: be wary of «refund» messages.

4
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.600
Say it aloud: “I'm self-employed.”.
